# Although upstream does add tags to git, they correspond to the *beginning*
# of work on a particular version, not a stable release.  Instead, stable
# releases exist as the current tip of the "release-X.X" branch in the
# upstream git.  See [1] for discussion.
#
# To obtain an orig tarball, use "debian/rules get-orig-source".
#
# [1] https://github.com/Macaulay2/M2/issues/418
